  "rootCause": {
    "qId002": "Material condition was interpreted as conditional syntax only, so two independently assessable changed return contracts were summarized outside the required ledger grammar.",
    "dId001": "The repeated-ID rule required a merge key structurally but did not state directly enough that every entry sharing the ID must carry the same non-empty key.",
    "fId001Run02": "The main Skill prohibited equivalent inventory rereads, but Fix Review still said to inspect the fix diff without explicitly naming the collector patches as the authoritative diff for all-uncommitted scope.",
